  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy to Support for the development of an IGAD Institutional   Assessment and subsequent development of a refined IGAD Strategic     Plan for Somalia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen &#xe4;r ett konsultuppdrag f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja Inter-Governmental Authority on Developments (IGADs) institutions&#xf6;versyn f&#xf6;r sitt arbete med fredsbyggande i Somalia. Sverige bidrar till &#xf6;versynens f&#xf6;rsta fas som t&#xe4;cker institutions&#xf6;versynen. Planen &#xe4;r sedan att andra givare ska st&#xf6;dja en reviderad strategisk plan f&#xf6;r IGADs arbete i Somalia, med institutions&#xf6;versynen som grund.</narrative>
  </description>
